<< /A 38 0 R /Alt (Panel A shows a scatter plot correlating IFNG production with cytokine numbers per assay, including a red regression line, shaded confidence interval, and correlation statistics. Panel B displays a stacked bar chart of mean cytokine mass for different clones, with legend indicating cytokine types and correlation values. Panel C presents a heatmap with hierarchical clustering of scaled concentrations for four cytokines across several clones, using a color scale from blue \(low\) to red \(high\). Panel D features a principal component analysis biplot, labeling clones and cytokine variables along two principal component axes, with vectors representing cytokine contributions.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 29 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
